{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fluid simulation of splashes and fire fluid simulation of splashes and fire","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire.md","fileName":"Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 18:17\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Particle and Destruction VFX]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Particle and Destruction VFX","Particle Motion Forces and Lifetime","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fluid simulation of splashes and fire fluid simulation of splashes and fire","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire.md","fileName":"Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire","heading":"Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Fluid dynamics handles interacting material that cannot be convincingly represented by a simple cloth or isolated particle path. The book moves a sphere through a simulated liquid container to generate wake, foam, splash, and ripples, then describes converting the solved motion to a mesh for surfacing. A voxel-based gas example changes fuel and temperature controls to move from smoke toward ignition and fire. Such effects require specialized interaction calculations beyond the basic forces in [[Particle Motion Forces and Lifetime]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Particle and Destruction VFX","Particle Motion Forces and Lifetime","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fluid simulation of splashes and fire fluid simulation of splashes and fire","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire.md","fileName":"Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Particle and Destruction VFX","Particle Motion Forces and Lifetime","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}